# ============================================================================
#  VEYE — code only in the repository history.
#
#  Tracked: the static prototypes (build/, admin-panel/prototype-client/), the
#  platform application (platform/api, platform/web, docker, scripts), the
#  permanent test suites and the launcher.
#
#  Not tracked (kept ON DISK only): every document and note, client files,
#  design references and wireframes, environment files, keys and tokens,
#  session/tool data, archives, generated and machine-local material.
# ============================================================================

# ---- documents, notes and internal material ----------------------------------
*.md
